# Counter Strike 1.6

> Start a headless Counter Strike 1.6 server.
> More information: <https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=729345010>.

- Start the server:

`{{path/to}}/hlds_run -game cstrike +map {{de_dust2}}`
